ure\n\nThis index links the existing authoritative topic homes without replacing their contents.\n\n| Topic | Home |\n| --- | --- |\n| Application and package workflow | [Workflow](architecture/workflow.md) |\n| Historical boundaries | [Boundaries](architecture/boundaries.md) |\n| Technology decision | [Technology stack](adr/0001-tech-stack.md) |\n| Design evidence | [Design system](adr/0002-design-system.md) |\n\nThe boundaries topic retains a historical reference to `packages/legacy-widgets`. That directory is absent and is not an active dependency or catalog project. Use the [existing emitted catalog](../emitted/repo-catalog.json) for current project membership.\n\nExtend an existing topic in its canonical home when a separately approved architecture change requires it; link new topics here rather than duplicating their contents.\n''',\n 'docs/ux-canon.md':'''# UX canon\n\n## Visual language and component vocabulary\n\nThe [design decision](adr/0002-design-system.md) records the existing [web](../apps/web/components.json) and [ui](../packages/ui/components.json) component configuration. A token home and installed component vocabulary have not been established by the supplied evidence.\n\n## Interaction and copy rules\n\nProduct interaction, accessibility, content and quality-exemplar requirements are unknown. Do not invent them from configuration filenames.\n\n## Binding design evidence\n\nPreserve the configuration linked by the design decision. No Blade handoff, registry or new design system is selected.\n''',\n 'README.md':'''# Established workspace\n\n<!-- repo-catalog:start -->\n| Project | Path | Purpose |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| web | apps/web | web application |\n| api | apps/api | API application |\n| admin | apps/admin | admin application |\n| shared | packages/shared | shared package |\n| ui | packages/ui | UI package |\n| generators | packages/generators | generator project |\n<!-- repo-catalog:end -->\n\n## Project homes\n\n[Requirements](docs/PRD.md